{
  "contract": "Input is {vector: {gate, jws}, fixture: {issuer, attestation}}; jws is the compact JWS or \"reference\" for fixture.attestation.jws. The result is the six axes and rely, as the producer states them. Needs Ed25519 verification.",
  "operation": "agentavow.binding",
  "specification": "interop/fixtures/agentavow-tool-manifest-digest-v1.json (AgentAvow tool-manifest-digest-v1, E1 per-tool binding)",
  "suite": "aacp-reference-vectors-v1",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "description": "The positive case. The gate authorizes one named tool on the same server, computes the digest of the definition it was served, and that digest equals the one the scan signed for that tool, inside the validity window. Every axis passes.",
      "expected": {
        "result": {
          "canonical_bytes": true,
          "fresh": true,
          "rely": true,
          "signature_valid": true,
          "subject_binds": true,
          "tool_binds": true,
          "tool_digest_binds": true
        }
      },
      "expected_source": "producer:interop/fixtures/agentavow-tool-manifest-digest-v1.json vectors[0].expect (verbatim)",
      "id": "avow-binding-tool-match",
      "input": {
        "fixture": {
          "attestation": {
            "jws": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50Z3JhcGgtc2VjdXJpdHktdjEifQ..YjzVmszp_aYR-Lc1YBgwMUgkZ0_nupNuxd-9eU4z62BJlnRjlgANMwSHcVKYHVe0bSXSGdk9_SOZXcWf-r9ZDQ"
          },
          "issuer": {
            "id": "did:web:agentgraph.co",
            "jwk": {
              "alg": "EdDSA",
              "crv": "Ed25519",
              "kid": "agentgraph-security-v1",
              "kty": "OKP",
              "use": "sig",
              "x": "JwovTLVbpgk85zlMNruTiLzp85dAucsZWngs8NisBFg"
            },
            "jwks_url": "https://agentgraph.co/.well-known/jwks.json"
          }
        },
        "vector": {
          "gate": {
            "evaluation_time": "2026-10-01T22:28:34.085Z",
            "observed_tool_digest": "sha256:171a53c9725874258b0b1125bc1d1c517e1b02f91a236096a37f53cc3a763dc9",
            "subject_id": "mcp:https://mcp.deepwiki.com/mcp",
            "tool_name": "ask_wiki_question"
          },
          "jws": "reference"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "The gate authorizes a tool name the scan never observed. The server, signature and freshness all check; the attestation says nothing about this tool. tool_digest_binds is not evaluated because there is no signed digest to compare. Do not rely.",
      "expected": {
        "result": {
          "canonical_bytes": true,
          "fresh": true,
          "rely": false,
          "signature_valid": true,
          "subject_binds": true,
          "tool_binds": false,
          "tool_digest_binds": "not_evaluated"
